[Desktop Entry]
Version=1.0
Type=Application
TryExec=rexx
Icon=system-software-update
Exec=/opt/BSF4ooRexx/install/runRexxScriptJava.sh /opt/BSF4ooRexx/install/setupJava.rex
Terminal=true
Path=/opt/BSF4ooRexx/install
Name=Configure Java to use
Comment=Allows to select which installed Java should be used. Please make sure that the Java's bitness (32-Bit or 64-Bit) matches the bitness of the installed ooRexx (run "rexx -v" to learn about the bitness of ooRexx, see the output entitled line "Addressing Mode:").
